        "heading": "Where does Cgi Federal sell most of its services?",
        "body": "Other Computer Related Services is the largest market at $440M, followed by Computer Systems Design Services at $212M and Computer Facilities Management Services at $193M. The Department of State is the top buying agency at $221M, with the General Services Administration at $172M and the Department of Justice at $138M. Departments such as Veterans Affairs and Health and Human Services also appear among top buyers at $136M and $76M respectively."
